  "description": {
    "html": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Elevate your festive wardrobe with this Cream Prabal Silk Indo Western Set, featuring elegant floral embroidery on premium silk fabric. Designed with a sophisticated Chinese collar and an open-style silhouette, this three-piece ensemble includes an embroidered Indo Western jacket, kurta, and pants. Perfect for weddings, receptions, engagements, and festive celebrations.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Key Features</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Premium Cream Prabal Silk Fabric</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Elegant Floral Embroidery</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Classic Chinese Collar</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Open-Style Indo Western Jacket</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Medium-Length Silhouette</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Matching Cream Kurta &amp; Pants</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">3-Piece Indo Western Set</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Ideal for Weddings, Receptions &amp; Festive Occasions</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Styling Tips</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Pair with cream embroidered juttis for a timeless ethnic look.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Style with tan leather slip-on shoes for a refined reception ensemble.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Complete the outfit with brown leather sandals for elegant festive celebrations.</div>",
    "text": "Elevate your festive wardrobe with this Cream Prabal Silk Indo Western Set, featuring elegant floral embroidery on premium silk fabric. Designed with a sophisticated Chinese collar and an open-style silhouette, this three-piece ensemble includes an embroidered Indo Western jacket, kurta, and pants. Perfect for weddings, receptions, engagements, and festive celebrations.\nKey Features\nPremium Cream Prabal Silk Fabric\nElegant Floral Embroidery\nClassic Chinese Collar\nOpen-Style Indo Western Jacket\nMedium-Length Silhouette\nMatching Cream Kurta & Pants\n3-Piece Indo Western Set\nIdeal for Weddings, Receptions & Festive Occasions\nStyling Tips\nPair with cream embroidered juttis for a timeless ethnic look.\nStyle with tan leather slip-on shoes for a refined reception ensemble.\nComplete the outfit with brown leather sandals for elegant festive celebrations.",
    "parsed": {
      "intro": {
        "text": [
          "Elevate your festive wardrobe with this Cream Prabal Silk Indo Western Set, featuring elegant floral embroidery on premium silk fabric. Designed with a sophisticated Chinese collar and an open-style silhouette, this three-piece ensemble includes an embroidered Indo Western jacket, kurta, and pants. Perfect for weddings, receptions, engagements, and festive celebrations.",
          "Ideal for Weddings, Receptions & Festive Occasions",
